{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Machinery.HeckeTauAssignmentSwapConjugation","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Machinery.HeckeTauAssignmentSwapConjugation","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Machinery.HeckeTauAssignmentCoherence"],"declarations":9,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.tauAssignment_swap_no_target_transition","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.tauAssignment_swap_no_target_transition","kind":"theorem","line":166,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeTauAssignmentSwapConjugation.lean#L166-L246","doc":"**The swap edge admits NO transition map on the isotypic target**:\nthere is no function `T` — linear or otherwise — with\n`τ_{(j,i)} = T ∘ τ_{(i,j)}`. The witness state (coefficients `−I` at\nthe identity and `1` at `σᵢ`) lies in the kernel of the\n`(i,j)`-assignment but not of the `(j,i)`-assignment, so the swap\ntransition exists only at cell level (`cellRestrict_swap`) and provably\ndoes not descend. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.cellRestrict_swap","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.cellRestrict_swap","kind":"theorem","line":157,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeTauAssignmentSwapConjugation.lean#L157-L162","doc":"Cell restriction intertwines the swap with the index involution. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.cellElem3_swap","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.cellElem3_swap","kind":"theorem","line":144,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeTauAssignmentSwapConjugation.lean#L144-L155","doc":"The `(j,i)`-cell is the `(i,j)`-cell re-indexed by `swap6`; the\nlongest entry closes by the braid relation. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.swap6","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.swap6","kind":"def","line":141,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeTauAssignmentSwapConjugation.lean#L141-L142","doc":"The index involution realizing the pair swap on the six-cell. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.tauAssignment_conj_coherent_bar","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.tauAssignment_conj_coherent_bar","kind":"theorem","line":123,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeTauAssignmentSwapConjugation.lean#L123-L137","doc":"The conjugate `H^{0,1}` partner square. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.tauAssignment_conj_coherent","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.tauAssignment_conj_coherent","kind":"theorem","line":105,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeTauAssignmentSwapConjugation.lean#L105-L121","doc":"**W-conjugation edges are coherent**: the assignment at the\nconjugated pair is the pullback of the assignment at the source pair\nalong the inner automorphism. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.cellElem3_conj","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.cellElem3_conj","kind":"theorem","line":82,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeTauAssignmentSwapConjugation.lean#L82-L103","doc":"The cell transports along the inner automorphism of a\npair-conjugating element. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.simple_ne_conj","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.simple_ne_conj","kind":"theorem","line":74,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeTauAssignmentSwapConjugation.lean#L74-L80","doc":"Simple-distinctness transports along a conjugation of pairs. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.simple_ne_one'","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.simple_ne_one'","kind":"theorem","line":65,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeTauAssignmentSwapConjugation.lean#L65-L70","doc":"Simple reflections are nontrivial (length 1 vs length 0). ","signatureChunk":0}]}